n the same way that someone isn't  cancer they have cancer yeah  and the business world is hungry for  stability and that's why there's such a  stigma around this but talking about it  and showing you still can't perform at a  high level and there's life after is  really what makes this book so important  married with a baby yeah congratulations  you two got through all of that together  and you married me did my wife manuela  you know she stuck by me through this  and you can imagine  um after what we went through with the  violence i struck her during that  episode the fact that she stayed with me  that her mom said andy it's just like  diabetes you got to take care of  yourself it was really healing that's  the way to put it that's true  thank you andy dunn thank you very much  the book is burn rate it's brave it's on  sale right now pick it up

